OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinuing overnight, these locally
OL,7,Fheavy and perhaps wintry across the
OL,8,FPennines and the Cheviot Hills.
OL,9,FBecoming widely chilly by the morning
OL,10,Fwith a frost likely for many western
OL,11,Fparts. Breezy at times, especially in
OL,12,Fand around showers. Minimum
OL,13,FTemperature 0C.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FScattered showers and
OL,16,Fvariable cloud, although showers
OL,17,Fbecoming increasingly confined to
OL,18,Fcoastal fringes through the day as
OL,19,Fwinds ease. Cold overnight with a
OL,20,Fwidespread frost. Maximum Temperature
OL,21,F6C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
