OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain spreads east on
OL,7,FWednesday after a clear, frosty start.
OL,8,FBreezier and much milder Thursday and
OL,9,FFriday with occasional periods of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
